   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We have committed $5 million in Lok Capital Fund IV (Lok IV), managed by Lok Investment Management Limited. Lok IV aims to invest in early and growth-stage companies in financial services (including fintech) and tech-enabled business models in agriculture, healthcare and climate. The objective of the fund is to promote access, quality, and affordability of services in India, predominantly in Tier 2 and 3 towns, rural areas and states with low per capital income. The fund is also 2X-qualified.</narrative>
   </description>
